    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey quick question. i bought a really expensive ergonomic chair for my home office setup last month. since i'm a freelance designer, do i put that under business expenses or is it considered a personal draw? i'm trying to get my quickbooks sorted for the end of the year.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
